      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, im looking at my long term energy portfolio and it's pretty heavy on traditional oil and gas. given how fast the world is moving toward net zero and all the new climate regs coming out, do u think the transition to renewables is basically an inevitability at this point? or is there still a real case to be made that it's a speculative economic risk?",
