    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on diversifying, but it feels like you're dismissing the immediate practicalities. you're saying the risk of \"not adapting\" is certain, but the risk of grid failure or a resource-driven recession is also very real and could happen much sooner. aren't you basically saying that any economic caution regarding fossil fuels is just an outdated mindset that ignores the math of the transition?",
